turn to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10128","city":"CS1037","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[78,34,84,93,71,52],"title":-1,"rank":"4","loyalty":"100","reputation":"3100","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1017805","helmet":"WP1025305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10128","city":"CS1037","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[78,34,84,93,71,52],"title":-1,"rank":"4","loyalty":"100","reputation":"3100","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1017805","helmet":"WP1025305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10128","city":"CS1039","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[78,34,84,93,71,52],"title":-1,"rank":"4","loyalty":"100","reputation":"3100","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1017805","helmet":"WP1025305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1050","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[78,34,84,93,71,52],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"1550","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1017805","helmet":"WP1025305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10128","city":"CS1039","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[78,34,84,93,71,52],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"1550","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1017805","helmet":"WP1025305"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"蜀国重臣，蜀国四相之一。为人宽厚容人，曾因醉酒误事险被刘备处死，被诸葛亮力保。庞统死后随诸葛亮一同前往益州支援刘备。后诸葛亮北伐期间主导成都政事，以“社稷之器”的才能被诸葛亮选定为继承人，在诸葛亮病逝后主持蜀汉军政十二年，延续了诸葛亮的治国理念，稳定了蜀汉政局。延熙元年，受命开府。次年加大司马，总揽蜀汉军政，曾制定由水路进攻曹魏的计划，但未被采纳。延熙七年，因病辞政事，将益州刺史之职让与费祎。延熙九年，蒋琬因病而卒。","tc":"蜀國重臣，蜀國四相之一。為人寬厚容人，曾因醉酒誤事險被劉備處死，被諸葛亮力保。龐統死后隨諸葛亮一同前往益州支援劉備。后諸葛亮北伐期間主導成都政事，以“社稷之器”的才能被諸葛亮選定為繼承人，在諸葛亮病逝后主持蜀漢軍政十二年，延續了諸葛亮的治國理念，穩定了蜀漢政局。延熙元年，受命開府。次年加大司馬，總攬蜀漢軍政，曾制定由水路進攻曹魏的計劃，但未被采納。延熙七年，因病辭政事，將益州刺史之職讓與費祎。延熙九年，蔣琬因病而卒。","en":"A key minister of Shu and one of the Four Chancellors. A man of broad-minded tolerance, he was once nearly executed by Liu Bei for a drunken lapse but was saved by Zhuge Liang's intercession. After Pang Tong's death, he accompanied Zhuge Liang to reinforce Liu Bei in Yi Province. Later, during Zhuge Liang's northern expeditions, he oversaw political affairs in Chengdu. Recognized by Zhuge Liang as possessing ‘the talent for managing the state,’ he was selected as Zhuge Liang's successor and led Shu Han's military and civil affairs for twelve years after Zhuge Liang's death, extending his governance philosophy and stabilizing the regime. In the 1st year of Yanxi (238), he was authorized to open his own administrative office. The following year he was promoted to Grand Minister, commanding all Shu Han military and political matters. He devised a plan to attack Cao Wei via waterways, but it was not adopted. In the 7th year of Yanxi (244), he resigned due to illness, transferring the post of Lt. Governor of Yi Province to Fei Yi. In the 9th year of Yanxi (246), Jiang Wan died of illness.","jp":"蜀の重臣で、蜀の四相の一人。人柄は寛厚で度量が広く、かつて酩酊して職務を怠り劉備に処刑されかけたが、諸葛亮のとりなしにより救われた。龐統の死後は諸葛亮に従って益州へ赴き劉備を支援した。その後、諸葛亮の北伐中は成都の政務を主導し、「社稷の器」たる才能を認められて諸葛亮の後継者に指名され、諸葛亮の病没後は十二年にわたり蜀漢の軍政を取り仕切り、諸葛亮の治国理念を継承して蜀漢の政局を安定させた。延煕元年に命を受けて開府し、翌年には大司馬を加えられて蜀漢の軍政を総覧した。かつて水路より曹魏を攻める計画を立てたが、採用されるには至らなかった。延煕七年、病により政務を退き、益州刺史の職を費禕に譲った。延煕九年、蒋琬は病により没した。","kr":"촉나라의 중신이자 촉나라 사상 중 한 사람이다. 성품이 너그럽고 도량이 넓어 남을 잘 포용했다. 일찍이 숙취로 일을 그르쳐 유비에게 처형당할 뻔했으나 제갈량이 힘써 구명해 주었다. 방통이 죽은 뒤 제갈량과 함께 익주로 가 유비를 지원했다. 이후 제갈량의 북벌 기간 동안 성도의 정사를 주도했으며, ‘사직의 재목’이라는 역량을 인정받아 제갈량에게 후계자로 선택되었다. 제갈량이 병사한 뒤에는 12년 동안 촉한의 군사정치를 이끌며 제갈량의 치국 이념을 계승해 촉한의 정국을 안정시켰다. 연희 원년, 개부하라는 명을 받았다. 이듬해 대사마에 올라 촉한의 군사정치를 총괄했으며, 수로를 통해 조위를 공격하는 계획을 세우기도 했으나 채택되지 않았다. 연희 7년, 병으로 정사에서 물러나며 익주자사직을 비의에게 양보했다. 연희 9년, 장완은 병으로 숨을 거두었다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10114","remark":"","surname":"蒋","surnameTc":"蔣","surnameEn":"Jiang","surnameJp":"蒋","surnameKr":"장","surnameOther":"","name":"琬","nameTc":"琬","nameEn":"Wan","nameJp":"琬","nameKr":"완","nameOther":"","word":"公琰","wordTc":"公琰","wordEn":"Gongyan","wordJp":"公琰","wordKr":"공염","wordOther":"","icon":"蒋琬","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"207","city":"CS1050","gender":"0","rule":"78","force":"34","wise":"84","politics":"93","charm":"71","will":"52","ruleTalent":"10","forceTalent":"2","wiseTalent":"12","politicsTalent":"15","charmTalent":"8","willTalent":"4","weaponMaster":"11/11/11/11/11/85/35/11","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"1002302","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"1006105;1004605","warSoul":"S1002405;S1001905","battleSoul":"1019605","debateSoul":"1001505","warSoulPoint":"6000","battleSoulPoint":"1100","debateSoulPoint":"7000","strategy":"1002305","strategy2":"1009701;1006501","professions":"2/2/0/3/4/3/2/3/4/3/1/1/2/3/0/5/3/4/5/3/1/4/0/3","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"6","compatible":"52","loyalty":"0","reputation":"1550","evaluate":"7000","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"179","show":"205","death":"246","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"0","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"5","weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1017805","helmet":"WP1025305","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"0/0;2/1;12/2;15/1;21/2;31/2;41/1;59/1;42/2;3/1;68/0;23/0","father":"","mother":"","children":"WJ10470/100;WJ10794/100","family":"","modInfo":"","brother":"","couple":"","otherRelationship":"WJ10123/6;WJ10017/6;WJ10119/6","belief":"0","isVIP":"1","startVIPYe